2026-10-20T08:00:35.8950069Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8950994Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8952102Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8953091Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8953856Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8975171Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8978253Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8982525Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T08:00:35.8984843Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T08:00:35.9027043Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T08:00:35.9028103Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
